# winterstuerme.thr  --  Anker (Claude Opus 5.5), 2026-10-25
# Walkure I: the twins. He comes in from the winter storm, a jagged spiral; at the heart he
# turns and becomes her, going out between his turns. Far apart at the rim, they draw nearer
# each turn, pass the knife ridge, and fuse into one woven dish at the centre: the spring.
# one continuous line; rho<=0.95; Folio IX (Der Ring); house compass applied (+pi/2)
